      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure a smooth setup and safe operation of the Nexus-7 LiDAR module, please follow these steps:\n\n**Pre-Installation Checklist**\n\n1. Verify the power supply voltage is within the recommended range of 12V-24V DC.\n2. Connect the 4-pin aviation connector to the module.\n3. Mount the module using the provided M3 screw holes on the base.\n\n**Initial Setup**\n\n1. Connect the power supply to the module.\n2. Wait for the green LED to indicate that the module is ready.\n3. Run the 'nexus_init' command via the terminal to complete the initial setup.\n\n**Operating the Nexus-7 LiDAR Module**\n\n* Always follow the safety guidelines:\n\t+ Never look directly into the lens during operation.\n* Refer to the troubleshooting guide for any issues that may arise.\n\n**Troubleshooting and Maintenance**\n\n* Consult the troubleshooting guide for step-by-step solutions to common issues.\n* Regularly inspect the module for any signs of damage or wear.\n\nThis draft is concise, easy to follow, and prioritizes safety. It also avoids unnecessary complexity and ensures that the content is relevant and useful for the field techs.",
