      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start and definitely safe. It's a bit brief though. I just checked the tool and it gave this draft a pretty low score because there isn't much \"structural depth.\" \n\nCould you expand on this a bit? Maybe add more specific sections for things like \"Safety Precautions,\" \"Hardware Specifications,\" and \"Software Configuration\"? Try to make it feel more like a 'complete' professional manual. I still really need it to be useful for the techs, so don't add fluff, but if you can increase the number of headings and sub-points to help that complexity score, that would be a huge help for getting it through the gate.",
